# Graphify update

After modifying matching code files in this session, run:

```bash
graphify update .
```

AST-only refresh — no API cost. Keeps `graphify-out/graph.json` aligned with the code.

Doc or image-only changes are not covered by `graphify update .`. For those, run `/graphify --update` or a full `/graphify .` rebuild before treating the graph as current.
